{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b> And to the altar</b> — two times in the Masorah: למשכן ולמזבח, בין האולם ולמזבח. Hints at the opinion that says the divine speech came to Moses from above the copper altar — i.e., למשכן ולמזבח, that the Shechinah dwells upon the altar, and likewise it is written בין האולם ולמזבח etc., and they said: 'Spare, YHWH, Your people' — for there they would stand and pray."], :book "exodus", :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :zh-Hans, :chapter 40, :timestamp "2026-07-27T13:47:39.010477642Z", :translated-from :en, :model "glm-5.2"}